.                 duplicates drop age vmt, force

Duplicates in terms of age vmt

(0 observations are duplicates)
.                 sort age
.                 forvalues y = 1(1)`ub'{
  2.                         local ice_miles_traveled`y' = vmt[`y'] * ${EV_VMT_car_adjustment}
  3.                 }
.         }       

