.                 duplicates drop age vmt_by_state_age, force
.                 sort age
.                 forvalues y = 1(1)`ub'{
  2.                         local ev_miles_traveled`y' = vmt_by_state_age[`y']
  3.                 }
.         }

.         else{
.                 use "${assumptions}/evs/processed/ev_vmt_by_age", clear
.                 local ub = `lifetime'
.                 duplicates drop age vmt, force

Duplicates in terms of age vmt

