> tal_sales2013' + ${`bev_cf'_cf_carbon_2014} * `total_sales2014') / (`total_sales2011' + `total_sales2012' + `total_sales2013' + `total_sales2014'))
.         local q_carbon_no_ice_mck = `q_carbon_no_ice' / `beh_response'
. 
. 
.         ** need US-wide stuff for scaling cost curve outputs
