> `"Utilities"' 10 `"Total WTP"' 12 `""Program" "Cost""' 13 `""State" "Subsidy""' 14 `""Federal" "Subsidy""' 15 `""Gas" "Tax""' 16 `""Profits" "Tax""' 17 `""Climate" "FE""' 18 `""Govt
> " "Cost""' ///
