> 10 `""Program" "Cost""' 11 `""State" "Subsidy""' 12 `""Federal" "Subsidy""' 13 `""Gas" "Tax""' 14 `""Profits" "Tax""' 15 `""Climate" "FE""' 16 `""Govt" "Cost""' ///
> 

