. *************************
. /* 4. WTP Calculations */
. *************************
. /*
> 
> Calculation to get the percent of the cost per unburned acre that the government pays that goes to inframarginal vs marginal farmers. We first get the percent of payments that are m
> arginal vs inframarginal. 
> 
> Inframarginal payments include: the 82% of the farmers that do not comply only get the upfront payment, the proportion of inframarginal farmers out of the compliers (0.28 * prop_inf
> ra), and the upfront payment for the proportion of marginal farmers out of the compliers (0.28 * (1 - prop_infra) * 0.375)
> 
> */
. 
. local prop_infra_tot = 0.161 / (`not_burned'+0.161)

. 
. local noncompliance = 1 - 0.183 // Percent of people who don't comply 

. local prop_infra_compliers = 0.183 * `prop_infra_tot'

. local prop_marg_compliers = 0.183 * (1 - `prop_infra_tot')

. 
. 
